Modifications for deps: the compose file's fixed project name is dropped, the
goharbor/* images are pinned to HARBOR_VERSION v2.15.4, and the init service
writes a 2048-bit PKCS#1 token key (openssl genrsa -traditional), since Harbor
core refuses the PKCS#8 key OpenSSL 3 writes by default, and makes the registry
storage volume writable for the registry's harbor user (uid 10000), so pushes
work.
